    "id": "2085219334280839299",
    "text": "We can now run GPT-5.6 Luna Max over 5,000 extra times a week for only $10.\n\nA lot of us are out of Codex usage right now. So we wired Luna Max from OpenCode Go directly into our Codex Router!!\n\nIt's the same Luna we already run in Codex, it just spends the $10 sub instead of our ChatGPT plan, and the reasoning level still works so we keep it on max.\n\nThe caps are 5,100 Luna requests per week and 10,250 per month. \n\nCodex cuts us off, we've still got a full week of Luna sitting there.\n\nAnd we never leave Codex. just one more model in the picker, grab it when the wall hits and keep going.",
    "raw_text": {
      "text": "We can now run GPT-5.6 Luna Max over 5,000 extra times a week for only $10.\n\nA lot of us are out of Codex usage right now. So we wired Luna Max from OpenCode Go directly into our Codex Router!!\n\nIt's the same Luna we already run in Codex, it just spends the $10 sub instead of our ChatGPT plan, and the reasoning level still works so we keep it on max.\n\nThe caps are 5,100 Luna requests per week and 10,250 per month. \n\nCodex cuts us off, we've still got a full week of Luna sitting there.\n\nAnd we never leave Codex. just one more model in the picker, grab it when the wall hits and keep going.",
